      ":question/problem": "The row echelon form matrix $A$ is given below. What are its **non**-pivot columns?\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & -6 & -6 & 3 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 8 & 4 & 8 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 8 & 6 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
